Both traditional approaches {{cite:4686a3339ee111830aaa401798cd9d5b250b255d}}, {{cite:1264a8e2e5bdb59696aecbdbc8002f60030c8e19}}, {{cite:3f8c385ee7ff8b95530430b09f015a7fc1461545}}
and deep learning methods {{cite:26f7c032d55b445c4281d00fb640d149130a4f84}}, {{cite:10f5380f2aa88db0993566140a8b42f4d4b06530}}, {{cite:c6b7706dfba4f31008055b6f4325b2105beb5dc4}}, {{cite:153823b90d5a2ce207b9fd6d00eee8324af6c9cf}}, {{cite:358be4d3b510bcb2e32a9af3167f1b871efbb99a}}, {{cite:5da95afeae54a55e3c0837f6aa75ca780bde880e}} had made great efforts on reconstructing the structures of images
in producing visually realistic results.

