RNNs have been successfully applied to time series
classification {{cite:2570497e517b154b42bee9f1cf9a1d19bf10975c}}, {{cite:b56fc4908614d6ef6912d6cee27e1dce2e1a53ef}}, {{cite:711bbc0641e92c2275a76434492c32e85f1bcfb1}} and forecasting
across many domains including financial data predictions, {{cite:acd17e1863bee148ce17bd5e4cf949093eab833a}}, {{cite:d2d7d54f938d4e767afcc1daf439d70f13ca0558}}, {{cite:9fad0dbac524377b409c7d06e59a360d7611fd6a}}, {{cite:a219634a3afd8fc4c3cc6d7f1c3da86532ceb1f6}}
speech {{cite:c1d88101afeb92e9ba54fd0adfac8d8070704f39}}, {{cite:97cf0a2240c33fe99e25d068518f4523518c5bd7}}, {{cite:50da9780b7d2e6af2b3431424126885dc86cf05d}}, {{cite:81a3619534e8db59a973264329902d408c1ef15a}}, {{cite:beec60ed85a39febed2b930e067c6366f171c9b1}}, {{cite:427953ad61af9f4fa28236766d015cf3d2f6d04f}} and handwriting
recognition, {{cite:6f7cbd9bcc939a49301a88645bbf61484229e45e}}, {{cite:808609971dd4b187dd9a19aee4326d1fcf2bfb37}} natural language processing, {{cite:35701b9114fdd9b55e1562e42b995ea8694da0cc}}, {{cite:1cdab855069aa60d89df28df6954b6930fcc56d2}} machine translation, {{cite:d28f88b11fd73151fea73ebb42eec7e50a2928f2}}, {{cite:9a1c499179551a8483fe511b22be5f56a3a3c3af}}, {{cite:235a508ea13771e497b4da455f9cc9be693a707a}}
healthcare, {{cite:0ff5dddbaa4293c512fb20bfab71274ba18040a4}}, {{cite:7fd3ae7417b5ee9ce012d62c161dec5c21c38c21}}, {{cite:0db722bed25689d1ab0caed0f7e80d1dd6054523}}, {{cite:4f58075543869fcac4476602b3d61fa2d2c9d124}}
traffic speed prediction, {{cite:c1a14774d10270a8c6ecb3825692e648a9220195}}, {{cite:6ce444f9f78f6b1ad97eee992af0c52d30a9563b}}, {{cite:22033685ce32442676f73717c03d13cce156cd55}} music, {{cite:480400206d2ff0f6f24e276f89d23f43a0a21312}}, {{cite:8e2f1d92ab7fc1b9315adb9b43c1a5334752d918}} video, {{cite:fdf31af92960db3fdf016b5a00bfe3e3c3bbf766}}
meteorology, {{cite:f61785f372a06eabbde914230b4377aa05a8e6aa}} molecular drug discovery, {{cite:cc8c073c5bdc367cf1ffb799770219715ec16623}}, {{cite:d65f85f49d6004350cdf968e9bf0148961ef1aac}}
demand forecasting, {{cite:b7d0c7874fe312576d8a7e9b794c5cbbcc4f15e5}}, {{cite:d33dd64359d2d34bda5cb04ddc01773eebc287a9}} gaming, {{cite:ce618e318c59f902ebc073cf0b31578a27fd718e}}
remote sensing {{cite:221fed31b89aa7b595a8b1d7cd5fe1d3249e88e0}}, {{cite:3c67abab35052752880d9edadec129dec6fd7e99}} computer code generation {{cite:88a433379a411914885b0629a9b75585c92b9f03}} and others.

